WEBVTT

00:03.880 --> 00:05.000
Your Grace...

00:05.290 --> 00:07.290
Here's that item you requested.

00:07.630 --> 00:09.710
Excellent work, Zenia.

00:11.710 --> 00:13.830
If this plan succeeds,

00:13.830 --> 00:16.500
it shall bring the demon race one step closer

00:14.710 --> 00:18.000
<b>Demon Family</b>

00:14.710 --> 00:18.000
<b>BEAUTIES</b>

00:16.500 --> 00:19.580
to conquering the Human Realm.

00:18.000 --> 00:21.000
<b>Level 1 Demon Lord</b>

00:18.000 --> 00:21.000
<b>and One Room Hero</b>

00:21.080 --> 00:21.670
<b>Demon Family</b>

00:21.080 --> 00:21.670
<b>BEAUTIES</b>

00:21.090 --> 00:21.670
<b>Portrait Album</b>

00:21.830 --> 00:23.290
Ta-da!

00:21.830 --> 00:26.250
<b>#4 The Hero's New Challenge</b>

00:23.290 --> 00:26.250
Rejoice, Hero! I have good news for you!

00:26.420 --> 00:28.880
The hell's this? Let's see here...

00:28.880 --> 00:31.750
"Demon Family Beauties Portrait Album"...?

00:32.750 --> 00:35.580
It's an act of benevolence
to express my sympathies!

00:35.580 --> 00:36.710
You should be grateful!

00:36.710 --> 00:38.380
What're you talkin' about?

00:38.380 --> 00:40.540
Back in the day, you were in high demand.

00:40.540 --> 00:43.000
But nowadays, you have zero
romantic prospects, am I right?

00:43.000 --> 00:44.380
You lack a feminine touch!

00:44.380 --> 00:45.420
That's not true... He's got me.

00:45.420 --> 00:45.920
Romantic prospects?
That's not true... He's got me.<b></b>

00:45.920 --> 00:46.420
Romantic prospects?

00:46.630 --> 00:49.040
Nah, no girlfriends for me, thanks.

00:49.250 --> 00:53.040
Oh, don't be silly! Deny it all you like,
but you've got to be lonely.

00:53.540 --> 00:56.750
This album contains pictures and profiles
of only the most beautiful bombshells,

00:56.750 --> 00:59.040
hand-picked from my underlings.

00:59.040 --> 01:01.000
I had Zenia compile it for me.

01:01.000 --> 01:05.250
Choose whichever one you like best,
and I'll handle everything else!

01:05.250 --> 01:08.750
What?! Yer outta your mind
if you think I'd date a demon!

01:08.750 --> 01:10.210
Huh? Why not?

01:10.210 --> 01:11.460
Well, for one thing...

01:11.460 --> 01:14.960
I'm the dude who went around
slaughtering 'em ten years ago!

01:14.960 --> 01:16.710
How're they gonna feel about that?

01:16.710 --> 01:18.330
Oh, is that all?

01:18.330 --> 01:19.920
That's no big deal.

01:19.920 --> 01:24.250
I might've mentioned this before,
but us demons have seven lives.

01:24.250 --> 01:27.460
So when it comes to life versus death,
we're not very picky.

01:27.460 --> 01:29.080
I think yer missin' the point...

01:29.080 --> 01:31.580
C'mon, there's no harm in just looking!

01:31.580 --> 01:35.040
Trust me, men would kill to get
their hands on ANY of these girls.

01:42.670 --> 01:43.830
<b>Name: Zenia</b>

01:42.670 --> 01:43.830
<b>Job: Secretary</b>

01:44.130 --> 01:46.040
OF COURSE IT'S THAT SHE-DEVIL!

01:46.710 --> 01:49.210
Zenia's not a bad option, don'tcha think?

01:50.040 --> 01:51.920
Well, uh...

01:52.380 --> 01:54.790
Did she take these photos herself?

01:54.790 --> 01:56.880
The hell was goin' through her head...?

01:56.880 --> 01:59.420
She was attempting to
tickle your fancy, no doubt!

01:59.420 --> 02:00.460
Looky there!

02:00.460 --> 02:02.830
Erm... A woman who gets violent
when she's drunk

02:02.830 --> 02:04.380
AND chases me down the street naked?

02:04.380 --> 02:05.540
I'll pass...

02:05.540 --> 02:08.880
As long as she doesn't drink alcohol,
she's a very wholesome girl.

02:08.880 --> 02:12.880
Between these poses and the outfit,
I'm not entirely convinced that's the case...

02:13.210 --> 02:15.920
Then have a look at the other
potential candidates!

02:15.920 --> 02:19.170
There are plenty to choose from!
You won't regret it, I swear!

02:19.330 --> 02:20.500
<b>Name: Rebecca</b>

02:19.330 --> 02:20.500
<b>Job: Commander,</b>

02:19.340 --> 02:20.500
Oink!

02:19.340 --> 02:20.500
<b>Demon Beast Corps 6th Squadron</b>

02:20.630 --> 02:22.000
THAT'S A STRAIGHT-UP PIG!

02:22.000 --> 02:23.130
EXCUSE ME?!

02:23.130 --> 02:27.210
Rebecca is one of the orcs' fiercest warriors
and a member of the Demon Beast Corps elite!

02:27.210 --> 02:28.420
What do you mean, "pig"?!

02:28.420 --> 02:29.880
No, but she's LITERALLY a pig!

02:29.880 --> 02:31.380
What part of that DOESN'T scream "pig"?!

02:31.380 --> 02:33.670
Rebecca is an extraordinary woman, Max!

02:33.670 --> 02:35.420
Plus, she's good with her hands.

02:35.420 --> 02:36.250
See?

02:36.250 --> 02:38.670
She forged her favorite set of armor herself!

02:38.670 --> 02:40.210
She's the embodiment of femininity!

02:40.210 --> 02:41.460
Impressive...

02:41.460 --> 02:45.630
But, uh, I'm not so sure that forging
home-made armor really counts as "feminine"...

02:47.460 --> 02:49.670
Compared to the others,
this one seems relatively normal.

02:49.670 --> 02:52.500
Oh! Destelle, eh? You've got good taste!

02:49.670 --> 02:52.500
<b>Name: Destelle</b>

02:49.670 --> 02:52.500
<b>Job: Private First Class, Magic Corps</b>

02:52.500 --> 02:55.630
She's clever, proficient at magic,
and an exceptional warrior.

02:55.830 --> 02:59.830
There's a somewhat lackadasical air about her,
but that's just part of her charm!

02:59.830 --> 03:01.040
Wow...

03:02.210 --> 03:05.250
In hand-to-hand combat, she uses her
coiled lower half to strangle her enemies,

03:05.250 --> 03:06.920
so she does have an aggressive side.

03:06.920 --> 03:09.170
For God's sake, WHY?!

03:09.460 --> 03:12.170
It may not look it, but I believe
she enjoys playing sports.

03:12.170 --> 03:14.420
Athletic women are attractive, don'tcha think?

03:14.420 --> 03:16.080
That's not the issue!

03:16.080 --> 03:18.000
Why does she have to be half-snake?!

03:18.000 --> 03:19.710
Why can't she be whole-human?!

03:19.710 --> 03:21.830
Alright, then what about this girl?

03:22.670 --> 03:29.000
<b>Name: Yvonne     Job: Waitress</b>

03:22.880 --> 03:24.580
She's a full-blooded human.

03:24.580 --> 03:26.630
Yeah, maybe she USED to be!

03:26.630 --> 03:27.830
Anyone with a functioning brain

03:27.830 --> 03:29.000
could tell you that's not a human!

03:29.130 --> 03:31.290
Jeez, Max. Way to be picky...

03:31.290 --> 03:32.920
Goddammit!

03:32.920 --> 03:34.920
Anyway, this book is full of fantastic women.

03:34.920 --> 03:37.920
I'm sure you'll find one who suits your tastes.

03:37.920 --> 03:40.540
I remember fightin' this dragon
and that giant squid.

03:40.540 --> 03:42.580
They were strong as hell...

03:43.040 --> 03:45.580
Wait, so they were female...?

03:45.580 --> 03:48.750
What was even the point of
including them in this thing...?

03:48.750 --> 03:51.130
Well? Which one caught your eye?

03:51.130 --> 03:52.630
None of 'em, ya moron!

03:52.630 --> 03:54.580
This thing's just a field guide
for weird demon creatures!

03:54.580 --> 03:57.380
I swear, nothing is ever
good enough for you...

03:57.380 --> 04:00.500
Okay, enlighten me:
What kind of women DO you like?

04:00.500 --> 04:03.420
I feel like it ain't gonna make
a difference even if I tell ya...

04:03.420 --> 04:06.540
But first and foremost,
she's gotta at least LOOK human.

04:06.750 --> 04:10.290
Uh-huh... In other words,
bipedal with arms and legs...

04:10.290 --> 04:11.130
Yup.

04:11.130 --> 04:12.920
So her head can be detachable, right?

04:12.920 --> 04:14.330
NO, IT CANNOT!

04:14.330 --> 04:17.830
Well then, wouldn't Zenia
fit the majority of your criteria?

04:17.830 --> 04:21.540
Erm... I'd prefer someone who's
not as painfully unpleasant...

04:22.290 --> 04:27.250
She's gotta be smart...
Oh yeah, AND she's gotta be chill.

04:27.500 --> 04:30.170
She's gotta be a good cook...
and a total babe...

04:30.170 --> 04:33.710
She's gotta have a sexy figure...
and dark, silky hair!

04:33.960 --> 04:36.080
If ya tick those boxes, I can't complain.

04:36.080 --> 04:37.750
Somebody's standards are too high...

04:37.750 --> 04:40.630
In that case, which of my soldiers could I...?

04:43.000 --> 04:44.460
Metamorphose!

04:49.710 --> 04:53.080
Voila! Whaddya think, Hero?

04:55.750 --> 04:58.790
You're looking at the secret identity
I use to disguise myself!

04:58.790 --> 05:03.250
Behold! I've got the soft, glossy black hair
and luscious body you so desire!

05:03.250 --> 05:06.500
I happen to look like your dream girl, don't I?

05:06.710 --> 05:09.580
And as you're already aware,
my cooking is delicious;

05:09.580 --> 05:12.710
I excel at cleaning and doing laundry;
I'd make the perfect wife and mother!

05:12.710 --> 05:16.290
And don't forget my refreshingly
frank and honest personality!

05:16.670 --> 05:18.790
Oh, what a conundrum!

05:18.790 --> 05:21.920
You and I are supposed to be bitter rivals...

05:21.920 --> 05:26.080
Ah, but I suppose if we were to
get married or something,

05:26.080 --> 05:28.290
I could make powerful connections
in the Human Realm...

05:28.290 --> 05:29.880
Just kidding-

05:56.170 --> 05:57.880
Th-that must be Zenia!

05:57.880 --> 05:59.960
Coming! Gimme just a second!

06:00.210 --> 06:02.130
Good afternoon, milord.

06:03.330 --> 06:05.580
Is something the matter?
Your face is bright red.

06:05.580 --> 06:06.380
Huh?!

06:06.380 --> 06:08.250
Are you coming down with a cold?

06:08.250 --> 06:10.330
N-no, my face isn't red! I'm fine!

06:10.330 --> 06:12.080
Nothing happened, okay?!

06:18.380 --> 06:21.330
Will you join my ranks, Hero?

06:21.330 --> 06:24.250
You shall live seven lifetimes just as I.

06:24.250 --> 06:29.000
Why not savor the gift of
immortality at my side?

06:29.000 --> 06:30.460
You must be joking!

06:30.460 --> 06:33.420
Throw away my dignity as a human
to become a demon?!

06:33.580 --> 06:35.330
I'd rather DIE first!

06:35.330 --> 06:37.420
How unfortunate...

06:37.420 --> 06:41.130
Then sink into the depths of eternal oblivion!

06:41.830 --> 06:44.210
Will you join my ranks, Hero?

06:44.540 --> 06:48.130
Be reincarnated as a demon
and receive astonishing power.

06:48.130 --> 06:50.750
You shall live seven lifetimes just as I.

06:51.040 --> 06:52.080
What...?

06:52.420 --> 06:55.460
Didn't ya try that bullshit on me
ten years ago?

06:55.460 --> 06:56.420
Indeed.

06:56.420 --> 06:59.880
At the time, it was obvious that
you'd refuse my generous offer.

06:59.880 --> 07:01.670
But whaddya say now?

07:01.670 --> 07:02.670
Are you stupid?

07:02.670 --> 07:04.040
No, I'm serious.

07:04.040 --> 07:06.960
No frickin' way!
So cut the crap, wouldja?

07:07.130 --> 07:09.710
You didn't even give me a chance to explain...

07:09.710 --> 07:12.000
Will you at least hear me out first?

07:12.000 --> 07:14.420
Yer bein' weirdly persistent
about this, ain'tcha?

07:14.670 --> 07:17.630
<b>An Introduction to</b>

07:14.670 --> 07:17.630
<b>Demonic Reincarnation</b>

07:15.170 --> 07:17.630
"Now you, too, can be a demon!"

07:18.040 --> 07:20.670
Demonic Reincarnation 101, yay!

07:21.170 --> 07:23.290
What's with the shady seminar...?

07:23.540 --> 07:26.460
"What are the perks of giving up my humanity

07:26.460 --> 07:28.630
and being reborn as a demon?"
you might be wondering...

07:28.630 --> 07:31.080
Well, I'm gonna lay it all out
on the table for ya!

07:31.250 --> 07:34.670
<b>An Introduction to</b>

07:31.250 --> 07:34.670
<b>Demonic Reincarnation</b>

07:31.380 --> 07:33.670
Let's start with the very first perk!

07:33.670 --> 07:34.750
It's none other than...

07:34.750 --> 07:36.130
a competitive salary!

07:35.130 --> 07:38.040
<b>Rolling in the dough!</b>

07:36.130 --> 07:38.040
Why's this about money all of a sudden?!

07:38.290 --> 07:40.130
'Cause Fred wasn't lying, was he?

07:40.130 --> 07:42.710
When he said that your savings
are nearly gone?

07:44.290 --> 07:47.290
If you join my ranks,
your financial problems will disappear.

07:47.290 --> 07:50.080
Yeah, well...
I have a little bit of cash saved up.

07:50.080 --> 07:52.000
Earned it a long time ago...

07:52.000 --> 07:54.670
I ain't wonderin' where my
next meal's gonna come from.

07:54.880 --> 07:57.170
Maybe not tomorrow or the day after...

07:57.170 --> 07:59.790
But what are you going to do
ten or twenty years from now?

07:59.790 --> 08:01.710
Get off my back, wouldja?

08:01.710 --> 08:04.040
I'll be long dead by then,
so it won't even matter.

08:04.040 --> 08:06.460
Oh my god, I can't believe you said that!

08:06.460 --> 08:10.000
Do you have any idea how stubborn
and unreasonable you sound?!

08:10.000 --> 08:12.420
That's absolutely right. It's foolish.

08:12.420 --> 08:14.380
If you were to work at my castle,

08:14.380 --> 08:17.210
we'd break your starting salary into
monthly payments of ¥480,000 after taxes

08:17.210 --> 08:21.040
and add a semi-annual bonus, allow for raises
from promotions, factor in a pension...

08:21.040 --> 08:23.290
Of course, this is all for the average soldier.

08:23.670 --> 08:27.920
So we'd need to take your solid skillset and
previous experience into consideration...

08:28.290 --> 08:30.460
I'd estimate a threefold increase,
at the very least...

08:30.460 --> 08:33.540
W-wait a minute, what?! Slow down...
What'd you just say?!

08:33.540 --> 08:34.880
Too low, eh?

08:35.250 --> 08:36.330
Okay then...

08:36.330 --> 08:38.630
What if we bump it up to a cool ¥2,500,000?

08:38.630 --> 08:41.920
You CAN'T be serious! Yer gonna
piss off the human labor force!

08:42.130 --> 08:43.630
Hold it, Your Grace!

08:43.630 --> 08:45.710
A high income might be nice,

08:45.710 --> 08:49.170
but one cannot live a luxurious life
without ample vacation time.

08:49.170 --> 08:50.670
Not to worry!

08:50.830 --> 08:55.420
<b>A reasonable work plan</b>

08:50.830 --> 08:55.420
<b>• Maximum 5 hours per day</b>

08:50.840 --> 08:55.420
The demons in our employ are always guaranteed
a comfortable working environment.

08:50.840 --> 08:55.420
<b>• No overtime</b>

08:50.840 --> 08:55.420
<b>• Total of 4 days off per week</b>

08:50.840 --> 08:55.420
<b>• Paid vacation is required</b>

08:55.500 --> 08:57.580
Each workday is five hours maximum!

08:57.580 --> 08:59.170
We NEVER require overtime!

08:59.170 --> 09:01.040
And you get four days off every week!

09:01.040 --> 09:02.750
Four days off?!

09:02.750 --> 09:04.500
That sounds fantastic, milord!

09:04.500 --> 09:07.040
Maintaining a healthy work-life balance
will be a piece of cake!

09:07.040 --> 09:10.080
In fact, I won't even know what to do
with all my free time!

09:10.330 --> 09:13.630
Is that a special privilege
for workin' at the castle?

09:13.630 --> 09:17.290
Huh? No. That'd be extremely unfair
to everyone else.

09:17.290 --> 09:20.790
It goes for those in the private sector
AND for public servants.

09:20.790 --> 09:22.920
It's a universal right for all demons.

09:22.920 --> 09:25.130
And society still functions?!

09:25.130 --> 09:27.420
It sure does! Smoothly, at that.

09:27.420 --> 09:28.670
Wait, milord!

09:29.290 --> 09:31.420
If there aren't any employee benefits,

09:31.420 --> 09:33.750
then why should job-seekers
choose to work for you?

09:33.750 --> 09:36.580
Oh, but there are PLENTY of employee benefits!

09:36.580 --> 09:38.630
We guarantee the opportunity to own a home

09:38.630 --> 09:41.290
within the castle's residential district
as well as the adjoining town!

09:41.290 --> 09:42.790
Educational assistance

09:42.790 --> 09:45.630
along with maternity leave AND
childcare leave are all provided, too.

09:45.630 --> 09:47.500
We also have various systems in place

09:47.500 --> 09:49.830
to make sure our lower-level
employees receive support.

09:49.830 --> 09:51.580
...Yer tellin' me demons give birth?

09:51.580 --> 09:53.420
Let's see... Ah, I nearly forgot.

09:53.580 --> 09:55.790
In addition to a durable,
disease-resistant physical form,

09:53.580 --> 10:03.330
<b>Body, mind, magic</b>

09:55.790 --> 09:59.670
a mind that will never deteriorate,
and an abundance of magic powers,

09:59.670 --> 10:01.920
you'll receive an immortal soul that,
even if you die,

10:01.920 --> 10:03.830
will be resurrected after a period of slumber.

10:04.080 --> 10:07.040
Don't gloss over the immortality part
like it's business as usual!

10:04.080 --> 10:07.040
<b>Immortality</b>

10:07.420 --> 10:08.750
<b>Employment Contract</b>

10:07.420 --> 10:08.750
<b>I agree to become a demon.</b>

10:07.420 --> 10:08.750
<b>Sign here</b>

10:10.670 --> 10:12.630
If you become our ally,

10:12.630 --> 10:16.000
you shall be freed from all of the pain
and suffering that human beings endure,

10:16.000 --> 10:19.170
including the fear of death.

10:22.290 --> 10:23.670
<b>Do it.</b>

10:23.670 --> 10:25.580
<b>Employment Contract</b>

10:23.670 --> 10:25.580
<b>I agree to become a demon.</b>

10:23.670 --> 10:25.580
<b>Sign here</b>

10:28.290 --> 10:32.790
Will you walk the path of
eternal life with me, Max?

10:33.000 --> 10:37.920
<b>Employment Contract</b>

10:36.040 --> 10:37.920
<b>Do it.</b>

10:45.880 --> 10:47.080
Sorry...

10:47.080 --> 10:48.750
On second thought, no...

10:50.630 --> 10:52.000
But why not...?

10:52.330 --> 10:54.540
Do you not want me as your boss?

10:54.880 --> 10:58.000
You'd be my subordinate,
but it's just a formality.

10:58.000 --> 11:00.000
Our relationship wouldn't change at all...

11:00.000 --> 11:01.210
No dice?

11:01.210 --> 11:04.290
Or is it your "human dignity"
that you mentioned ten years ago?

11:04.880 --> 11:08.880
And "being human"...
Is it really that important to you?

11:09.500 --> 11:11.380
What is "human dignity" anyway?

11:13.790 --> 11:16.790
Don't ask me a difficult question
and expect an answer.

11:17.000 --> 11:19.040
YOU'RE the one who brought it up!

11:19.040 --> 11:20.830
I was young and immature.

11:20.830 --> 11:24.000
I used to say shit like that
without knowin' what it meant.

11:24.000 --> 11:28.920
Just "being human" or whatever ain't even
the part I really care about anymore.

11:29.250 --> 11:30.790
How do I put this...?

11:30.790 --> 11:34.670
It's the "being ME" part.
I can't give that up so easily.

11:34.670 --> 11:36.460
What's that supposed to mean?

11:36.460 --> 11:39.000
Even if you're reincarnated,
you won't lose your memories.

11:39.000 --> 11:43.290
"Turn into a demon, get money
and power, live forever."

11:43.290 --> 11:45.790
If I do any of that, I ain't me anymore.

11:45.790 --> 11:47.580
I'd be somethin' else entirely.

11:47.580 --> 11:50.000
Although, compared to me from ten years ago,

11:50.000 --> 11:52.960
I guess I'm a completely different person now.

11:53.130 --> 11:57.830
Besides, not bein' able to die
sounds awfully annoying.

11:58.170 --> 12:00.420
Immortality might be a little too much.

12:00.420 --> 12:02.460
For a human anyway.

12:04.790 --> 12:09.330
I appreciate your generous offer,
but I must decline at this time.

12:09.790 --> 12:11.170
But I...

12:11.500 --> 12:14.420
I wanted to stay with you forever...

12:15.630 --> 12:17.880
O-oh, uh... never mind.

12:18.420 --> 12:20.080
That's a shame, Your Grace.

12:20.330 --> 12:21.750
Yes...

12:20.330 --> 12:26.670
<b>Too bad</b>

12:21.750 --> 12:23.670
But I suppose it's alright.

12:23.670 --> 12:26.670
That's the first time I've ever seen Max
think something over carefully.

12:27.080 --> 12:28.080
Max?

12:28.460 --> 12:30.460
I'll put the contract away for safekeeping.

12:30.460 --> 12:33.080
Should you ever decide to reincarnate,
please feel free to let me know.

12:33.080 --> 12:35.170
Is this just another Tuesday for you...?

12:35.380 --> 12:36.880
Make no mistake, Hero!

12:36.880 --> 12:40.750
Now that you've rejected my proposal,
it's up to YOU to get your life together!

12:41.040 --> 12:43.210
So start by setting some goals for yourself!

12:43.460 --> 12:47.710
And no more of this "I'll be dead
ten years from now" nonsense...

12:47.920 --> 12:50.630
I'm sorry. You're right...

12:51.290 --> 12:52.420
Okay then...

12:52.420 --> 12:54.130
Let's do this!

12:54.130 --> 12:55.920
I'll find a way to make money!

12:56.460 --> 12:57.750
Just you wait!

12:57.750 --> 13:01.080
I'll rake in more dough
than a damn demon's ever seen!

13:01.670 --> 13:03.880
It's the Hero in all his glory!

13:02.250 --> 13:03.880
<b>Menacing Aura</b>

